# Other mouths

This Worker is the mailbox. The handheld PWA in `app/` is one client.
[gantry-cab](https://github.com/shotah/gantry-cab) is the Android + Auto
app (`repos/gantry-cab`). iOS native is later — same Durable Object, no
second Worker.

Walk: [docs/frontends.md](docs/frontends.md).

If you change **frames, auth, queue, `ack`/`since`/`seq`, or thread
order**, say what Cab does with it. Additive JSON is fine (Cab drops
unknown keys). A new required field or `kind` needs a Cab change or
mailbox tolerance for the old client. Do not send `seq` / `at` from
a phone — the mailbox stamps those.

PWA-only paint (theme, font, Install) does not need Cab. Wire does.
